message: "If you use this toolkit, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PD-Design-Kit: Ge-on-Si Photodiode Design Toolkit for PAM-4 Optical Receivers"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-04-19"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.19652934
url: "https://github.com/iabdul-aal/PD-design-kit"
license: CC-BY-4.0
authors:
  - family-names: Ibrahim
    given-names: Islam
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
    affiliation: "MSc Photonics, Faculty of Engineering"
abstract: >
  A comprehensive design and simulation toolkit for Ge-on-Si O-band photodiodes,
  spanning system-level MATLAB modeling to device-level Lumerical FDTD and CHARGE
  simulations. Targets high-speed PAM-4 optical receivers at 1310 nm with >100 GHz
  bandwidth, reproducing results from Yang Shi et al., Photonics Research 12, 1 (2024).
keywords:
  - photodiode
  - germanium-on-silicon
  - silicon photonics
  - O-band
  - PAM-4
  - Lumerical FDTD
  - CHARGE simulation
  - optical receiver
  - 1310 nm
repository-code: "https://github.com/iabdul-aal/PD-design-kit"
